<title>UK: Rice cargo on ship at Montevideo damaged by water.</title>
<headline>Rice cargo on ship at Montevideo damaged by water.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus-registered cargo ship African Cape suffered water damage to its cargo of bagged rice in the no. 1 hold due to a rupture of the forepeak bulkhead and ingress of water, Lloyd's Shipping Intelligence Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 12,665 dwt African Cape arrived at Montevideo on December 5 and started loading on December 7.</p>
